          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The public Review method accepts a ClaimsPrincipal argument and authorizes it from its authentication flag and NameIdentifier claim; it does not bind that principal to a host-authenticated request.",
            "failureScenario": "A caller constructs a ClaimsPrincipal with an authenticated ClaimsIdentity and NameIdentifier \"fin-1\", then passes it with a ready draft. Review accepts the fabricated identity and records an approval for the allowlisted reviewer."
